OL,3,GNEWSABaby found dead in woods named
OL,4,Aafter murder arrests
OL,5,
OL,6,FA baby girl who died while camping with
OL,7,Fher family has been named by police.
OL,9,FLacey May Oxford, who was three months
OL,10,Fold, was pronounced dead at the scene
OL,11,Fin woodlands near Cheslyn Hay,
OL,12,FStaffordshire, on 5 September.
OL,14,FEmergency services were called to an
OL,15,Farea near a fishing lake off Strawberry
OL,16,FLane to reports of a child in cardiac
OL,17,Farrest at around 08:45 BST.
