OL,3,GNEWSABaby found dead in woods named
OL,4,Aafter murder arrests
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour people - a 42-year-old man and a
OL,7,F30-year-old woman from south
OL,8,FStaffordshire, a 20-year-old woman from
OL,9,FWolverhampton and an 18-year-old man
OL,10,Ffrom Walsall - were previously arrested
OL,11,Fon suspicion of murder. All four remain
OL,12,Fon conditional bail.
